bdul Aziz wrote that he accepted the compensation breakdown for the building, and fence but objected to what was proposed for built area, pylon and restrictive use (ROW)', 'Y', '2022-10-29', 'Y', 'Call', 'N', 'The compensation proposed was too small compared to current market price.', 'Open.', '2025-04-01 13:36:11.7535350 ', 20009, 21, 'D309& D6530 -GM', 'GERMP T&D'), ('GR-TL060', 'M', '2022-10-20', 'Nuha Colley', 'Letter', 'Muhamadou Camara', '7091763', 'The letter wrote by his legal rep dated 10/10/2022 claimed that the amount his clients  is been offered for compensation was too small for 100*40m plot of land', 'Y', '2022-10-29', 'Y', 'In Person', 'Y', 'Not applicable', 'Closed.', '2025-04-01 13:41:17.3655700 ', 20009, 21, 'D309& D6530 -GM', 'GERMP T&D'), ('GR-TL061', 'M', '2022-10-10', 'Nuha Colley', 'Letter', 'Abdoulie Bah', '2259228/2701034', 'In a letter dated 06/10/2022  Abdoulie stated that he acquired this land very closed to the highway for his company he was to setup and amount disclosed is very small compared to the current market price.', 'Y', '2022-10-29', 'Y', 'In Person', 'Y', 'Not applicable', 'Closed.', '2025-04-01 14:54:13.9066430 ', 20009, 21, 'D309& D6530 -GM', 'GERMP T&D'), ('GR-TL062', 'M', '2022-10-10', 'Nuha Colley', 'Letter', 'Ousman Bah', '7086647/9908035', 'In a letter sent to PIU Mr Bah stated that he will want to be compensated land for land.', 'Y', '2022-10-29', 'Y', 'In Person', 'Y', 'Not applicable', 'Open', '2025-04-01 14:59:15.5435110 ', 20009, 21, 'D309& D6530 -GM', 'GERMP T&D'), ('GR-TL063', 'M', '2022-10-10', 'Nuha Colley', 'Letter', 'Karim Touray', '3599754/3044047', 'Mr Touray In a letter sent to PIU office stated he will want to be proposed compensated land for land as a fair compensation to him', 'Y', '2022-10-29', 'Y', 'In Person', 'Y', 'Not applicable', 'Open', '2025-04-01 15:12:07.8554090 ', 20009, 21, 'D309& D6530 -GM', 'GERMP T&D'), ('GR-TL064', 'M', '2022-10-10', 'Nuha Colley', 'Letter', 'Moussa Diallo', '935700/74828